[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6126.709, "timestamp": "01:42:06", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6129.27, "timestamp": "01:42:09", "text": "所以，我必须从这里做出选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6131.43, "timestamp": "01:42:11", "text": "那我就不能再改了，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6133.03, "timestamp": "01:42:13", "text": "呃，不，不，你不可能总是喜欢每一个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6134.87, "timestamp": "01:42:14", "text": "你施放这个咒语的时候，就选它。喜欢，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6137.03, "timestamp": "01:42:17", "text": "例如，这次你想做什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6138.709, "timestamp": "01:42:18", "text": "元素主义重返空气中。下次你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6141.91, "timestamp": "01:42:21", "text": "可以在地球上进行元素魔法。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6143.91, "timestamp": "01:42:23", "text": "你可以随时选择。所以每次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6146.07, "timestamp": "01:42:26", "text": "你施放此咒语，然后选择其效果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6147.109, "timestamp": "01:42:27", "text": "想。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6150.47, "timestamp": "01:42:30", "text": "哦，那岂不是更好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6152.149, "timestamp": "01:42:32", "text": "是的，确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6155.43, "timestamp": "01:42:35", "text": "好的。所以这意味着如果我……如果我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6159.91, "timestamp": "01:42:39", "text": "实用工具的使用，我选择了 Thorn Web"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6163.51, "timestamp": "01:42:43", "text": "下次我就可以使用星网了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6164.55, "timestamp": "01:42:44", "text": "就这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6167.91, "timestamp": "01:42:47", "text": "糟糕。哦，你是说像罐头裂纹那样的。为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6170.79, "timestamp": "01:42:50", "text": "罐头撕裂。一旦你选择了这个，你就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6173.03, "timestamp": "01:42:53", "text": "只能在每次升级时更改。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6174.39, "timestamp": "01:42:54", "text": "向上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6177.43, "timestamp": "01:42:57", "text": "哦好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6178.39, "timestamp": "01:42:58", "text": "我以为你在说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6179.35, "timestamp": "01:42:59", "text": "元素主义。"}]